Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:31.25,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}隠してもダメ！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:31.25,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}藏着也不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:32.65,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFDDA4&}アピってもダメ！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:32.65,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&\}表现出来也不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.65,0:03:34.27,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}フィクションのラブコメは
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.65,0:03:34.27,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}书本里的恋爱喜剧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:35.35,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}嘘ばかり…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:35.41,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}那都是假的……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.41,0:03:36.71,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}焦ったらバレ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:36.71,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}一着急就会露馅
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:38.17,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}デレちゃったら負け？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:38.17,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}害羞了就输了么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.17,0:03:39.99,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}下心隠すのも
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.17,0:03:39.99,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}七七八八小心思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.99,0:03:40.93,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}必死です!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.99,0:03:40.93,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}非得藏住不可！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:42.30,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}触ってもいい？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:42.30,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}可以摸你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.30,0:03:43.68,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}ドキッてしてる？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.30,0:03:43.68,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}有没有心动？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:45.31,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}子ども扱いしても
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:45.31,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}把我成当小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.31,0:03:46.39,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}変わんない{\fn霞鹜文楷 Medium\b0}♡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.31,0:03:46.39,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}我也不会收敛哦{\fn霞鹜文楷 Medium\b0}♡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:47.89,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}分かってないな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:47.89,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}你还是不懂呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.89,0:03:49.27,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}ズバッといきな！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.89,0:03:49.27,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}那我就直说了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.27,0:03:50.94,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}親友の特権も
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.27,0:03:50.94,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}我或许也有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.94,0:03:52.06,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}あるかも...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.94,0:03:52.06,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}身为亲友的特权……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.06,0:03:54.73,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}作戦も駆け引きも
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.06,0:03:54.73,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}作战也好、计谋也好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.73,0:03:56.94,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}君には届かない
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.73,0:03:56.94,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}对你统统没用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.94,0:04:00.23,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}どうして好きにさせたの？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.94,0:04:00.23,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}我为什么会喜欢你？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.23,0:04:05.55,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}ラブコメは両思いじゃなきゃダメ！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.23,0:04:05.57,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}恋爱喜剧就一定得是两情相悦！
